        ["3"] = <"Li HK, Horton M, Bursell SE, Cavallerano J, Zimmer-Galler I, Tennant M, Abramoff M, Chaum E, Debuc DC, Leonard-Martin T, Winchester M; American Telemedicine Association Diabetic Retinopathy Telehealth Practice Recommendations Working Group., Lawrence MG, Bauman W, Gardner WK, Hildebran L, Federman J. Telehealth practice recommendations for diabetic retinopathy, second edition. Telemed J E Health. 2011 Dec;17(10):814-37. doi: 10.1089/tmj.2011.0075. Epub 2011 Oct 4. Review. PubMed PMID: 21970573.">
